(2490157, 341762, 51538, '<td valign="top">Water, even to someone not familiar with chemistry, is not that viscous.  As an image alone, it is interesting and the colour blue pleasing.  The simplicity is appealing.  Perhaps the title should be something like: "Viscosity."</td>', 'Water, even to someone not familiar with chemistry, is not that viscous.  As an image alone, it is interesting and the colour blue pleasing.  The simplicity is appealing.  Perhaps the title should be something like: "Viscosity."', '2006-06-06 14:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
