(2491515, 340638, 55838, '<td valign="top">Back to comment....this is very cool - feels darker in general than the original.  I like the bolt &amp; the heavy blood - good ideas.  The skin looks so leathery - like it''s not even real - it makes me want to touch it. Nice job.</td>', 'Back to comment....this is very cool - feels darker in general than the original.  I like the bolt & the heavy blood - good ideas.  The skin looks so leathery - like it''s not even real - it makes me want to touch it. Nice job.', '2006-06-06 20:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491529, 343638, 55838, '<td valign="top">Back to comment...This is beautiful.  Perfect really..I wouldn''t change a thing.  Great light &amp; coloring.  Good balance of dark behind the baby and the darkness of the leaves.  I''ll be shocked if you don''t ribbon.  Bumped you to a 10.</td>', 'Back to comment...This is beautiful.  Perfect really..I wouldn''t change a thing.  Great light & coloring.  Good balance of dark behind the baby and the darkness of the leaves.  I''ll be shocked if you don''t ribbon.  Bumped you to a 10.', '2006-06-06 20:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491564, 343818, 40718, '<td valign="top">The original is better.  Both confuse me with the title, because I see cooling towers and I think nuclear, but perhaps these are used for coal too.  This one suffers big time from the PP in the smoke.  Can you see the artifact rings?</td>', 'The original is better.  Both confuse me with the title, because I see cooling towers and I think nuclear, but perhaps these are used for coal too.  This one suffers big time from the PP in the smoke.  Can you see the artifact rings?', '2006-06-06 21:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
