(2491657, 343740, 59415, '<td valign="top">It''s like emo meets Nebraska. Cool shot.  I don''t understand it all but then I don''t have to.  I don''t want to just skip this one, and I think it is the color that is doing it for me.  I like it.</td>', 'It''s like emo meets Nebraska. Cool shot.  I don''t understand it all but then I don''t have to.  I don''t want to just skip this one, and I think it is the color that is doing it for me.  I like it.', '2006-06-06 21:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491663, 342891, 59415, '<td valign="top">I love flowers, and this is a beautiful one.  The black background and the soft color of the flower really make it an enjoyable image.  I also like the shallow dof that draws you to the center of the flower.</td>', 'I love flowers, and this is a beautiful one.  The black background and the soft color of the flower really make it an enjoyable image.  I also like the shallow dof that draws you to the center of the flower.', '2006-06-06 21:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491665, 341976, 59415, '<td valign="top">What can I say about this except outstanding.  The color of this photo is so interesting that I am forced to look at the details of the image like the moss on the railing, and the tree limbs.  Didn''t take me long to know I like this photo.</td>', 'What can I say about this except outstanding.  The color of this photo is so interesting that I am forced to look at the details of the image like the moss on the railing, and the tree limbs.  Didn''t take me long to know I like this photo.', '2006-06-06 21:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491672, 342646, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like this image because the sky is so pretty and I think you really captured that.  And way in the distance the sun is hitting the other rocks wich is really cool.  My only drawback to giving it a 10 is the softness of the bushes in front of the major rock to the left.  It makes the rest of the image seem blurry to me even though it is not.  Great job I will give it strong marks.</td>', 'I like this image because the sky is so pretty and I think you really captured that.  And way in the distance the sun is hitting the other rocks wich is really cool.  My only drawback to giving it a 10 is the softness of the bushes in front of the major rock to the left.  It makes the rest of the image seem blurry to me even though it is not.  Great job I will give it strong marks.', '2006-06-06 21:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2491678, 343333, 59415, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones on this black and white.  Really nice.  I love how you are drawn to look at the bridge, your eyes just go right to it.</td>', 'Lovely tones on this black and white.  Really nice.  I love how you are drawn to look at the bridge, your eyes just go right to it.', '2006-06-06 21:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
