(2494850, 342013, 57886, '<td valign="top">Love the golden tone in this picture. Have not seen the "Take one" but this one I woulde say is excellent. Well done.</td>', 'Love the golden tone in this picture. Have not seen the "Take one" but this one I woulde say is excellent. Well done.', '2006-06-07 14:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494858, 340798, 14620, '<td valign="top">I like this one, but I have to say, I think I liked your original better.  I liked how the metal and wood worked off eachother giving a warm, natural feeling (which also worked well with the title). The background you chose here really changes that, making it cold and industrial.  Maybe that''s what you were going for.  Also, there is a loss of texture on the ring in this one (I''m assuming it''s the same ring). It''s seems much smoother and I think the texture was a good element in the original.  So by making the changes you did, you''ve changed the feeling of the photograph.  Nothing wrong with that, it''s just different.</td>', 'I like this one, but I have to say, I think I liked your original better.  I liked how the metal and wood worked off eachother giving a warm, natural feeling (which also worked well with the title). The background you chose here really changes that, making it cold and industrial.  Maybe that''s what you were going for.  Also, there is a loss of texture on the ring in this one (I''m assuming it''s the same ring). It''s seems much smoother and I think the texture was a good element in the original.  So by making the changes you did, you''ve changed the feeling of the photograph.  Nothing wrong with that, it''s just different.', '2006-06-07 14:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494860, 343517, 57886, '<td valign="top">OMG this is unreal... Good colors, nice cropping, clear and bright. Love it.</td>', 'OMG this is unreal... Good colors, nice cropping, clear and bright. Love it.', '2006-06-07 14:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494869, 340638, 57886, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture in every way... Love the postwork you did on it, cropping and choice of color (or not color :o)... Good job you did.</td>', 'Excellent picture in every way... Love the postwork you did on it, cropping and choice of color (or not color :o)... Good job you did.', '2006-06-07 14:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494873, 343092, 57886, '<td valign="top">Nice surrounding and a nice "moth?" Good range in colors, well from black to white.... Good shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-15 14:12:49.</i></td>', 'Nice surrounding and a nice "moth?" Good range in colors, well from black to white.... Good shot.', '2006-06-07 14:13:33.000000', '2006-06-15 15:12:49.000000', 1),
(2494874, 341215, 18197, '<td valign="top">This looks like a lovely fantasy world, maybe something out of Lord of the Rings, or Narnia, or Perelandra. The detail of the hillside gives it a lovely texture. The placement of the bridge is other worldly. The soft flow of the water belies its power. In short a stunning photo which I like very much. That being said, the water is <b>very</b> blue and I can''t help thinking I''d like it better if it weren''t quite so blue.</td>', 'This looks like a lovely fantasy world, maybe something out of Lord of the Rings, or Narnia, or Perelandra. The detail of the hillside gives it a lovely texture. The placement of the bridge is other worldly. The soft flow of the water belies its power. In short a stunning photo which I like very much. That being said, the water is very blue and I can''t help thinking I''d like it better if it weren''t quite so blue.', '2006-06-07 14:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494883, 342325, 57886, '<td valign="top">How nice :o) Nice job you did on the colors. The cottage looks somehow clean and neat although it is old and probably not so clean... Love this picture... Well done.</td>', 'How nice :o) Nice job you did on the colors. The cottage looks somehow clean and neat although it is old and probably not so clean... Love this picture... Well done.', '2006-06-07 14:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494893, 343517, 18197, '<td valign="top">Best of show in my opinion. Dark moody atmosphere. Nice reflections in the globe. Stunning capture of the water and its reflections. Very very nice composition. Where was it taken? I want to go there.</td>', 'Best of show in my opinion. Dark moody atmosphere. Nice reflections in the globe. Stunning capture of the water and its reflections. Very very nice composition. Where was it taken? I want to go there.', '2006-06-07 14:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
