(2494907, 343696, 57886, '<td valign="top">Aha :o) Very nicely done... You really get the feeling that the girl, for some reason, has been left alone out in the open.. Love the golden colors, cropping and feeling of this picture :o)</td>', 'Aha :o) Very nicely done... You really get the feeling that the girl, for some reason, has been left alone out in the open.. Love the golden colors, cropping and feeling of this picture :o)', '2006-06-07 14:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
