(2494928, 341582, 70, '<td valign="top">I knew this was you before you posted in the forums...recognized you from your self portrait. :) I do think you''ve done much better than your original here. The lighting and overall clarity are much improved and the lack of green orb is nice, too. Nice small catchlights in your eyes. Good job.</td>', 'I knew this was you before you posted in the forums...recognized you from your self portrait. :) I do think you''ve done much better than your original here. The lighting and overall clarity are much improved and the lack of green orb is nice, too. Nice small catchlights in your eyes. Good job.', '2006-06-07 14:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494940, 341582, 14620, '<td valign="top">Back to comment, lovely and you''re right, neatimage and freckles don''t mix. I''ve learned that mistake myself. :-)  Wonderful improvement from the first, no lens flare, closer crop on the subject and light and sharpness are greatly improved.  Well done and bumping to an 8</td>', 'Back to comment, lovely and you''re right, neatimage and freckles don''t mix. I''ve learned that mistake myself. :-)  Wonderful improvement from the first, no lens flare, closer crop on the subject and light and sharpness are greatly improved.  Well done and bumping to an 8', '2006-06-07 14:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2494945, 342891, 57886, '<td valign="top">Nice gray/pink color there. Also works well with the black background.. well done.</td>', 'Nice gray/pink color there. Also works well with the black background.. well done.', '2006-06-07 14:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
