(2494957, 343333, 70, '<td valign="top">Assuming I''ve got the original right, I think this version is much improved. A much stronger, more solid composition with nice lines and definitately a better b/w conversion with more contrast. Perhaps a tiny bit too dark under the arches but that doesn''t bother me at all. Nicely done.</td>', 'Assuming I''ve got the original right, I think this version is much improved. A much stronger, more solid composition with nice lines and definitately a better b/w conversion with more contrast. Perhaps a tiny bit too dark under the arches but that doesn''t bother me at all. Nicely done.', '2006-06-07 14:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
