(2495131, 342978, 14620, '<td valign="top">The composition and tonal range are much improved in this one.  I do like the child looking down in the first one, to me it adds to the feel of him being secluded, if you will, by his implied impairment.  But I know how children can be difficult at times. :-)  Well done overall.</td>', 'The composition and tonal range are much improved in this one.  I do like the child looking down in the first one, to me it adds to the feel of him being secluded, if you will, by his implied impairment.  But I know how children can be difficult at times. :-)  Well done overall.', '2006-06-07 15:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
