(2495254, 342476, 34659, '<td valign="top">She''s grown up a bit in the last couple of years and you''ve improved your skills as well.  ;-)  If my research is correct, this is Philos31.  And talk about an improvement!  To be honest, I thought this was Manny''s (I hope you take that as a compliment).  Outstanding.  The reflection in her eyes makes this portrait sing.  9</td>', 'She''s grown up a bit in the last couple of years and you''ve improved your skills as well.  ;-)  If my research is correct, this is Philos31.  And talk about an improvement!  To be honest, I thought this was Manny''s (I hope you take that as a compliment).  Outstanding.  The reflection in her eyes makes this portrait sing.  9', '2006-06-07 15:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2495255, 340638, 34659, '<td valign="top">I loved the first one and this one is even better.  Outstanding and powerful work.  I can''t imagine what it was like to even take this shot or create this scene...  Not sure I could do it.  10</td>', 'I loved the first one and this one is even better.  Outstanding and powerful work.  I can''t imagine what it was like to even take this shot or create this scene...  Not sure I could do it.  10', '2006-06-07 15:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2495263, 343638, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely stunning.  I don''t normally go for baby shots, but there''s something about this one that is just too good to tear my eyes away from.  The editing is superb - as is the composition.  Technically, it''s outstanding.  I can''t find anything wrong with it or that I would improve.  10<br/>(I just did some research and took a look at the original.  Jen, this is MAJOR improvement!)</td>', 'This is absolutely stunning.  I don''t normally go for baby shots, but there''s something about this one that is just too good to tear my eyes away from.  The editing is superb - as is the composition.  Technically, it''s outstanding.  I can''t find anything wrong with it or that I would improve.  10(I just did some research and took a look at the original.  Jen, this is MAJOR improvement!)', '2006-06-07 15:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
