(2495807, 341279, 43434, '<td valign="top">Nice Cliche .. my only issue here is what the knife seems quite scratched ... with this type of image I look for clean and crisp reflections ... this image though appears to have taken on the suggestions from the last challenge it was in .. I think has improved vastly.  But it is the little things that could .... the reflections of the mustard would look spactacular in a nice new (unmarked) knife you can''t fix that easierly in basic .. and I think it is easier to buy a new knife to get the image right .. than compromise the creation.</td>', 'Nice Cliche .. my only issue here is what the knife seems quite scratched ... with this type of image I look for clean and crisp reflections ... this image though appears to have taken on the suggestions from the last challenge it was in .. I think has improved vastly.  But it is the little things that could .... the reflections of the mustard would look spactacular in a nice new (unmarked) knife you can''t fix that easierly in basic .. and I think it is easier to buy a new knife to get the image right .. than compromise the creation.', '2006-06-07 18:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2495820, 343233, 43434, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of image.  There appears to be either some haloing or shadow thrown from the front image which detracts from the cleanness of the shot.  The piture also appears slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Interesting choice of image.  There appears to be either some haloing or shadow thrown from the front image which detracts from the cleanness of the shot.  The piture also appears slightly out of focus.', '2006-06-07 18:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
