(2501064, 342070, 30857, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge the first time, but for sure I would have voted high your original picture. Light is better in this second take though, it allows me to appreciate better all the details of this wonderful picture. Good job!!</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge the first time, but for sure I would have voted high your original picture. Light is better in this second take though, it allows me to appreciate better all the details of this wonderful picture. Good job!!', '2006-06-09 04:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501067, 343517, 30857, '<td valign="top">Took me a while but finally I could find the original picture for this one, and WOW What a change!!!. Overcast weather sure helped you to achieve the correct mood for this wonderful picture, and the reflections are awesome. You sure convinced me, you got a 10 from me. Good job!!.</td>', 'Took me a while but finally I could find the original picture for this one, and WOW What a change!!!. Overcast weather sure helped you to achieve the correct mood for this wonderful picture, and the reflections are awesome. You sure convinced me, you got a 10 from me. Good job!!.', '2006-06-09 04:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501078, 342856, 30857, '<td valign="top">Since the title wasn''t exactly the same, I had some trouble finding the original. Fortunately I had a hunch about who the photographer was (right bearmusic?) and checking on his posrtfolio I found what I was looking for :-). I really liked the original, but this second take is even better in my opinion, I love the mood of it ... Good job!!</td>', 'Since the title wasn''t exactly the same, I had some trouble finding the original. Fortunately I had a hunch about who the photographer was (right bearmusic?) and checking on his posrtfolio I found what I was looking for :-). I really liked the original, but this second take is even better in my opinion, I love the mood of it ... Good job!!', '2006-06-09 05:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501091, 343540, 49315, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective in this 10</td>', 'I love the perspective in this 10', '2006-06-09 05:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501123, 343830, 30857, '<td valign="top">Way better macro than the original, good light and reflection. I prefer the black background though. You did a good job with this second take, and if I gave you a 7 the first time, now you got a 9. Good job!!! :-)</td>', 'Way better macro than the original, good light and reflection. I prefer the black background though. You did a good job with this second take, and if I gave you a 7 the first time, now you got a 9. Good job!!! :-)', '2006-06-09 05:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501333, 342974, 12733, '<td valign="top">The shadows are great - I think they''d work better if tighter cropped. All that busy stuff on the left dilutes the effect, and cropping so the black bar runs off the bottom would eliminate the distracting brightness at the bottom.</td>', 'The shadows are great - I think they''d work better if tighter cropped. All that busy stuff on the left dilutes the effect, and cropping so the black bar runs off the bottom would eliminate the distracting brightness at the bottom.', '2006-06-09 08:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501335, 343062, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great, rich colors and great lighting to bring out the texture.</td>', 'Great, rich colors and great lighting to bring out the texture.', '2006-06-09 08:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501336, 342722, 35602, '<td valign="top">I like the color combinations on this one and the wonderful higlighting of light around the edges.  The actual statue, though, seems really rough.  Detail is there but I don''t know if you wanted it to be grainy or pixelated, but that is what it looks like on my monitor.</td>', 'I like the color combinations on this one and the wonderful higlighting of light around the edges.  The actual statue, though, seems really rough.  Detail is there but I don''t know if you wanted it to be grainy or pixelated, but that is what it looks like on my monitor.', '2006-06-09 08:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501337, 342476, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great portrait.  I like the soft blur on the skin.</td>', 'Great portrait.  I like the soft blur on the skin.', '2006-06-09 08:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501342, 341215, 35602, '<td valign="top">I remember this image.  It is definitely more saturated and the green is very velvety.  The water seems less overexposed as well.  Nice retake.</td>', 'I remember this image.  It is definitely more saturated and the green is very velvety.  The water seems less overexposed as well.  Nice retake.', '2006-06-09 08:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501346, 343747, 35602, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  I am not sure I like the background use of a door crack.  Image also seems somewhat off focus.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  I am not sure I like the background use of a door crack.  Image also seems somewhat off focus.', '2006-06-09 08:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501352, 342574, 35602, '<td valign="top">I loved this image initially, and I still think it is a great image.</td>', 'I loved this image initially, and I still think it is a great image.', '2006-06-09 08:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501354, 343251, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice saturation on the water.  Think it needs a bit more contrast and cleaner focus on the boats.</td>', 'Nice saturation on the water.  Think it needs a bit more contrast and cleaner focus on the boats.', '2006-06-09 08:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501356, 342918, 12733, '<td valign="top">The clean view up to the altar and the color of the floor make this a much better shot than the first. I think having a viewer taking in the scene was a great idea, but it didn''t work in the setting. I like this a lot better.</td>', 'The clean view up to the altar and the color of the floor make this a much better shot than the first. I think having a viewer taking in the scene was a great idea, but it didn''t work in the setting. I like this a lot better.', '2006-06-09 08:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501379, 343740, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very funny; I''m not sure of the point of all the pans, but they do work wll.</td>', 'Very funny; I''m not sure of the point of all the pans, but they do work wll.', '2006-06-09 08:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501426, 343696, 13879, '<td valign="top">This is SO going to ribbon! good luck!</td>', 'This is SO going to ribbon! good luck!', '2006-06-09 08:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501435, 343732, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a very different take on the subject. I like the dark, brooding feeling and the well captured shadow detail in the roof. On the other hand, I really liked the textures and lines of the original. They are really two very different pictures!</td>', 'This is a very different take on the subject. I like the dark, brooding feeling and the well captured shadow detail in the roof. On the other hand, I really liked the textures and lines of the original. They are really two very different pictures!', '2006-06-09 08:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501522, 343670, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great detail.  Could make a nice print.</td>', 'Great detail.  Could make a nice print.', '2006-06-09 09:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501568, 343233, 35602, '<td valign="top">I did not like the grain on this one.  It took away from the smoothness of the unicorn statue.  It appears you did try to reduce the noise on the foreground unicorn, but it is really out of focus.  Compositionally, the placement of the statues is very good.</td>', 'I did not like the grain on this one.  It took away from the smoothness of the unicorn statue.  It appears you did try to reduce the noise on the foreground unicorn, but it is really out of focus.  Compositionally, the placement of the statues is very good.', '2006-06-09 09:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502028, 342013, 37730, '<td valign="top">very interesting perspective great colour</td>', 'very interesting perspective great colour', '2006-06-09 12:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502029, 343515, 37730, '<td valign="top">super colour and focus</td>', 'super colour and focus', '2006-06-09 12:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502035, 342962, 37730, '<td valign="top">well done but i dont think i will buy any  :-)</td>', 'well done but i dont think i will buy any  :-)', '2006-06-09 12:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502282, 343727, 16046, '<td valign="top">Great "freeze" effect.</td>', 'Great "freeze" effect.', '2006-06-09 14:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502284, 343062, 48546, '<td valign="top">Nice work Pedro. I like the crop on this one better. More interest here.<br/>I know one of the comments was to boost the saturation, but I think you went a little too far.</td>', 'Nice work Pedro. I like the crop on this one better. More interest here.I know one of the comments was to boost the saturation, but I think you went a little too far.', '2006-06-09 14:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502289, 343605, 16046, '<td valign="top">The clouds in the forground add intrest, the pink openings in the sky look very sci-fi.</td>', 'The clouds in the forground add intrest, the pink openings in the sky look very sci-fi.', '2006-06-09 14:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502293, 342556, 16046, '<td valign="top">My hair stands up looking at this, well done</td>', 'My hair stands up looking at this, well done', '2006-06-09 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502299, 343696, 16046, '<td valign="top">Very good, color is outstanding.</td>', 'Very good, color is outstanding.', '2006-06-09 14:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502301, 343363, 16046, '<td valign="top">Awesome image, great comp.</td>', 'Awesome image, great comp.', '2006-06-09 14:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502304, 342476, 16046, '<td valign="top">smart portrait, I like the neat image effect.</td>', 'smart portrait, I like the neat image effect.', '2006-06-09 14:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
