(2502566, 342446, 30890, '<td valign="top">Stunning photograph,shame I can''t give it more than 10<br/>I''ve spent a lot of time in the metal bashing industry and never realised such beauty was right under my nose.</td>', 'Stunning photograph,shame I can''t give it more than 10I''ve spent a lot of time in the metal bashing industry and never realised such beauty was right under my nose.', '2006-06-09 16:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
