(2502817, 342891, 42495, '<td valign="top">Your original is very nice, but I like the softness of this one better.  The DOF pulls the eyes straight to the middle of the flower.  Lighting is improved.</td>', 'Your original is very nice, but I like the softness of this one better.  The DOF pulls the eyes straight to the middle of the flower.  Lighting is improved.', '2006-06-09 18:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502819, 343738, 35786, '<td valign="top">I looked at this for a bit &amp; my mind could not make sense of it. I just realized it''s because the cookie has blur but the milk is frozen?</td>', 'I looked at this for a bit & my mind could not make sense of it. I just realized it''s because the cookie has blur but the milk is frozen?', '2006-06-09 18:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502826, 342854, 35786, '<td valign="top">I like the wierd pose you caught him with- wish I could read his sign! :0)</td>', 'I like the wierd pose you caught him with- wish I could read his sign! :0)', '2006-06-09 18:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502830, 342548, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the Point of View challenge.  DOF really puts the focus on the model, and nice expression too.  Much of the picture is on the right side and unbalanced.  If you brought the model in from the left you may have been able to see more of her face without the rack in front of her forehead.</td>', 'Good idea for the Point of View challenge.  DOF really puts the focus on the model, and nice expression too.  Much of the picture is on the right side and unbalanced.  If you brought the model in from the left you may have been able to see more of her face without the rack in front of her forehead.', '2006-06-09 18:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502838, 342687, 35786, '<td valign="top">the sky looks unnatural...</td>', 'the sky looks unnatural...', '2006-06-09 18:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502839, 343671, 35786, '<td valign="top">you may have already heard this but the line on your hair is very jagged. next time try feathering your selection before you blur.</td>', 'you may have already heard this but the line on your hair is very jagged. next time try feathering your selection before you blur.', '2006-06-09 18:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502843, 341499, 35786, '<td valign="top">the blown out parts look awesome on this particular image</td>', 'the blown out parts look awesome on this particular image', '2006-06-09 18:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502849, 340739, 35786, '<td valign="top">much improved!!! :0D</td>', 'much improved!!! :0D', '2006-06-09 18:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2502857, 343217, 35786, '<td valign="top">the blue fringing on this is very unfortunate. otherwise a lovely shot! I wonder if you might have been able to select all but the star &amp; desaturated the blue hues away?</td>', 'the blue fringing on this is very unfortunate. otherwise a lovely shot! I wonder if you might have been able to select all but the star & desaturated the blue hues away?', '2006-06-09 18:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
