(2503677, 343780, 53147, '<td valign="top">I knew I had seen thisone around - just wasnt sure whose it was. This is the better shot of the two. I liek the darker blue color and whatever the thing in the background is (a bottle maybe?) gives the shot a much better balance. You can just barely see it in the original. This works much better. I expect to see a higher score on this one. Good job.</td>', 'I knew I had seen thisone around - just wasnt sure whose it was. This is the better shot of the two. I liek the darker blue color and whatever the thing in the background is (a bottle maybe?) gives the shot a much better balance. You can just barely see it in the original. This works much better. I expect to see a higher score on this one. Good job.', '2006-06-10 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
