(2506388, 343233, 29827, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this will not do very well I don''t think.  Out of focus, very noisy and of an ornament looks like a lack of any real effort.  Perhaps you did not have enough light which makes autofocus fail and increases the noise?</td>', 'Sorry, but this will not do very well I don''t think.  Out of focus, very noisy and of an ornament looks like a lack of any real effort.  Perhaps you did not have enough light which makes autofocus fail and increases the noise?', '2006-06-11 09:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506390, 343747, 29827, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really capture any interest, and is technically lacking in both exposure and noise.  Better luck next time!</td>', 'Doesn''t really capture any interest, and is technically lacking in both exposure and noise.  Better luck next time!', '2006-06-11 09:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
