(2506463, 343224, 26679, '<td valign="top">Great capture, not much I can say about improving this, maybee the lights on the left are a little distracting, but that is being exceedinly picky</td>', 'Great capture, not much I can say about improving this, maybee the lights on the left are a little distracting, but that is being exceedinly picky', '2006-06-11 10:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506465, 343556, 26679, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant. The only slight critism is the lighting is a little too strong near the top, but this is still a great image</td>', 'Simple and elegant. The only slight critism is the lighting is a little too strong near the top, but this is still a great image', '2006-06-11 10:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506466, 343834, 26679, '<td valign="top">Great sense of size here. I wish you had been able to take a slightly longer exposure to show the falls in a smoother ribbon like quality</td>', 'Great sense of size here. I wish you had been able to take a slightly longer exposure to show the falls in a smoother ribbon like quality', '2006-06-11 10:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506468, 343567, 26679, '<td valign="top">Great capture. You don''t see many of these around. I like the totally useless camouflage, unless its for hiding out in the "Blue Oyster Bar"</td>', 'Great capture. You don''t see many of these around. I like the totally useless camouflage, unless its for hiding out in the "Blue Oyster Bar"', '2006-06-11 10:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506471, 341253, 26679, '<td valign="top">I like the crop and the composition. My only concern is the internal border. I finf it slightly distracting, which is a shame as the image is lovely.</td>', 'I like the crop and the composition. My only concern is the internal border. I finf it slightly distracting, which is a shame as the image is lovely.', '2006-06-11 10:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506477, 342945, 26679, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the idea. For me a simple blue shy would also work very well as blue is the complementry colour for the amber light.</td>', 'I love the composition and the idea. For me a simple blue shy would also work very well as blue is the complementry colour for the amber light.', '2006-06-11 10:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506480, 343818, 26679, '<td valign="top">Great colours for ths long exposure. I feel that shifting it slightly off centre would give a more dynamic feel (assuming that is posible ).</td>', 'Great colours for ths long exposure. I feel that shifting it slightly off centre would give a more dynamic feel (assuming that is posible ).', '2006-06-11 10:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506484, 342918, 26679, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the light ceiling and the dark pews is quite strong. processing the pews separatly to show slightly more detail should help with this</td>', 'The contrast between the light ceiling and the dark pews is quite strong. processing the pews separatly to show slightly more detail should help with this', '2006-06-11 10:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506486, 343062, 26679, '<td valign="top">Great piece of graphical art. Photographically there is not a lot more you do with this. People will either love this or hate it. I am in the former camp. Good shot.</td>', 'Great piece of graphical art. Photographically there is not a lot more you do with this. People will either love this or hate it. I am in the former camp. Good shot.', '2006-06-11 10:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506554, 343668, 34134, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well executed!!</td>', 'Very creative and well executed!!', '2006-06-11 11:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506702, 342070, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe you got nearly the exact same position - definitely the same as far as the head/eye/beak is concerned.  You must have amazing patience!  All that said, I think I prefer the original.  That doesn''t mean this one didn''t score very well, though.  Nice work, as you always do.</td>', 'I can''t believe you got nearly the exact same position - definitely the same as far as the head/eye/beak is concerned.  You must have amazing patience!  All that said, I think I prefer the original.  That doesn''t mean this one didn''t score very well, though.  Nice work, as you always do.', '2006-06-11 14:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506703, 343853, 30982, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what the original shot looks like, but this one is wonderful.</td>', 'I have no idea what the original shot looks like, but this one is wonderful.', '2006-06-11 14:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506705, 340882, 30982, '<td valign="top">Omigosh.  The expression is absolutely priceless.  An amazing shot - prefect focus on the little guy''s (or gals - I don''t suppose you asked) face.</td>', 'Omigosh.  The expression is absolutely priceless.  An amazing shot - prefect focus on the little guy''s (or gals - I don''t suppose you asked) face.', '2006-06-11 14:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506706, 341976, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Great colors/tones/composition.  Not sure what the orignal was, but this one needs no improvement from my perspective.</td>', 'Lovely.  Great colors/tones/composition.  Not sure what the orignal was, but this one needs no improvement from my perspective.', '2006-06-11 14:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506709, 343224, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, Tim!  Exposure is perfect and I love that the reflections are pristine.  Well worth the re-shoot as evidenced by your hints on the score.  I''m glad you got the angle and perspective you wanted this time!</td>', 'Very nicely done, Tim!  Exposure is perfect and I love that the reflections are pristine.  Well worth the re-shoot as evidenced by your hints on the score.  I''m glad you got the angle and perspective you wanted this time!', '2006-06-11 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506710, 343515, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can''t remember who did this the first time, but I remember I liked it then, and I like it now, too.  Very crisp focus, lovely DOF.</td>', 'I can''t remember who did this the first time, but I remember I liked it then, and I like it now, too.  Very crisp focus, lovely DOF.', '2006-06-11 14:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506717, 341215, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m going to assume this is Jason''s.  Improvements over the original - straightened the bridge, lost the border.  :-)  Do I like this one better?  I''m not sure.  The first one was processed well but I''m sure there was some room for improvement.  This one seems a bit over the top to me, though.  I''ve no doubt the foliage is a wonderful green this time of year there, but is it really that green, and the water that blue?  It''s still a damn fine shot, but in my completely unprofessional opinion, I think I''d like something between the two.</td>', 'I''m going to assume this is Jason''s.  Improvements over the original - straightened the bridge, lost the border.  :-)  Do I like this one better?  I''m not sure.  The first one was processed well but I''m sure there was some room for improvement.  This one seems a bit over the top to me, though.  I''ve no doubt the foliage is a wonderful green this time of year there, but is it really that green, and the water that blue?  It''s still a damn fine shot, but in my completely unprofessional opinion, I think I''d like something between the two.', '2006-06-11 14:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506720, 340739, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not familiar with the original, but I do like this one!  Good lighting, I like the composition.  Fingernail seems a bit blown, maybe?  Ever so slightly distracting but only if you manage to get away from those eyes.</td>', 'I''m not familiar with the original, but I do like this one!  Good lighting, I like the composition.  Fingernail seems a bit blown, maybe?  Ever so slightly distracting but only if you manage to get away from those eyes.', '2006-06-11 14:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506722, 343727, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Crisp, clean depiction of the action, and I like how the background seems slightly muted compared to the horeses and jockeys.</td>', 'Great shot.  Crisp, clean depiction of the action, and I like how the background seems slightly muted compared to the horeses and jockeys.', '2006-06-11 14:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506725, 343696, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hey, now you have a matched set!  Love the contrasts in season, dress, and even model in that one has light hair, one dark.  Still love the original, by the way, but this makes a very fitting counterpart.</td>', 'Hey, now you have a matched set!  Love the contrasts in season, dress, and even model in that one has light hair, one dark.  Still love the original, by the way, but this makes a very fitting counterpart.', '2006-06-11 14:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506736, 343173, 30982, '<td valign="top">Amazing timing - seems unreal!</td>', 'Amazing timing - seems unreal!', '2006-06-11 15:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506739, 343670, 30982, '<td valign="top">Significant improvement over the original!</td>', 'Significant improvement over the original!', '2006-06-11 15:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506742, 343601, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m rather torn - I like both shots, but this one is the better of the two, I think.</td>', 'I''m rather torn - I like both shots, but this one is the better of the two, I think.', '2006-06-11 15:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506749, 342722, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think this works much better without the backdrop.  Lighting is very good - complementary colors work well too.</td>', 'I think this works much better without the backdrop.  Lighting is very good - complementary colors work well too.', '2006-06-11 15:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506766, 343431, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.  About the only thing I can offer is maybe blur the wood just a touch to make sure the focus stays on that lovely young, wistful face.  Very well done.</td>', 'This is gorgeous.  About the only thing I can offer is maybe blur the wood just a touch to make sure the focus stays on that lovely young, wistful face.  Very well done.', '2006-06-11 15:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506768, 343092, 30982, '<td valign="top">Loved this the first time, too.</td>', 'Loved this the first time, too.', '2006-06-11 15:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506770, 342990, 54778, '<td valign="top">OOOOOOH. Makes me want to lean over and touch the pretty kitty. It looks so soft and the expression is so pensive</td>', 'OOOOOOH. Makes me want to lean over and touch the pretty kitty. It looks so soft and the expression is so pensive', '2006-06-11 15:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
