(2511419, 343567, 41008, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think this is a great shot. To me, the ''green blob'' and fencing that some people complain about seems to be a nice element, as if the person with the camera is peering at this machine in the same way that a person in a warzone would; this perspective only adds to the absurdity of the pink designs on the tank.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, I don''t know my tanks very well... but is this a real Panzerkampfwagen? I''ve seen one in person and they''re the size of a small house.</td>', 'Personally, I think this is a great shot. To me, the ''green blob'' and fencing that some people complain about seems to be a nice element, as if the person with the camera is peering at this machine in the same way that a person in a warzone would; this perspective only adds to the absurdity of the pink designs on the tank. Unfortunately, I don''t know my tanks very well... but is this a real Panzerkampfwagen? I''ve seen one in person and they''re the size of a small house.', '2006-06-13 01:49:18.000000', NULL, 0),
