(2511461, 340823, 1031, '<td valign="top">Thanks all -- I wasn''t overwhelmed with cooperation from the kids -- I think the whole set-up and shoot took less than four minutes out of their recess period! I was aided in getting this shot by being able to use the tilt/swivel LCD on the Canon to hold the camera high overhead and shoot almost straight down, and get the hands closer to the shadows -- probably the number one comment on the original, along with the flowerpot.<br/> <br/>Link to original entry:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=2453" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/20/thumb/2453.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/20/thumb/2453.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/20/thumb/2453.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Thanks all -- I wasn''t overwhelmed with cooperation from the kids -- I think the whole set-up and shoot took less than four minutes out of their recess period! I was aided in getting this shot by being able to use the tilt/swivel LCD on the Canon to hold the camera high overhead and shoot almost straight down, and get the hands closer to the shadows -- probably the number one comment on the original, along with the flowerpot. Link to original entry: ', '2006-06-13 02:02:55.000000', NULL, 0),
