(2511472, 343747, 40484, '<td valign="top">Looked at this one and the original. The lighting in this one is rather flat compared to the original. Yes, the door is now white but you are missing the interest of the shadows that was there before. I think the closer crop would work well if you still had the same lighting as before. I actually liked the colour in the original better too because the green of the beads showed more, but that''s just me.</td>', 'Looked at this one and the original. The lighting in this one is rather flat compared to the original. Yes, the door is now white but you are missing the interest of the shadows that was there before. I think the closer crop would work well if you still had the same lighting as before. I actually liked the colour in the original better too because the green of the beads showed more, but that''s just me.', '2006-06-13 02:06:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2511479, 343795, 30861, '<td valign="top">Interesting vote distribution: only one vote 4-or-less, only 23 5''s, not a heck of a lot of real high scores. My blue-ribbon sunset was like that, except a few more higher scores, but anyway, we both succeeded in making shots that offended nobody and hung in there beautifully :-) Congrats on top 20!</td>', 'Interesting vote distribution: only one vote 4-or-less, only 23 5''s, not a heck of a lot of real high scores. My blue-ribbon sunset was like that, except a few more higher scores, but anyway, we both succeeded in making shots that offended nobody and hung in there beautifully :-) Congrats on top 20!', '2006-06-13 02:08:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2511481, 343575, 53964, '<td valign="top">The improvement over the original is immeasurable! :)</td>', 'The improvement over the original is immeasurable! :)', '2006-06-13 02:08:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2511484, 343785, 53964, '<td valign="top">I would have expected this to do MUCH better.</td>', 'I would have expected this to do MUCH better.', '2006-06-13 02:09:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2511487, 342556, 22301, '<td valign="top">I had this as one of my top three rated photos and knew it was going to ribbon the first time I saw it. But I want to know if you could tell us what challenge this was from originally? I went through your portfolio and saw nothing similar at all. I would love to compare your other shot to see how it improved. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-13 01:12:28.</i></td>', 'I had this as one of my top three rated photos and knew it was going to ribbon the first time I saw it. But I want to know if you could tell us what challenge this was from originally? I went through your portfolio and saw nothing similar at all. I would love to compare your other shot to see how it improved. ', '2006-06-13 02:09:55.000000', '2006-06-13 02:12:28.000000', 0),
(2511491, 342891, 30861, '<td valign="top">A distinct improvement! I think you got a little robbed here; I believe this should be flirting with top 10, at least. It''s quite exquisite. Note your vote distribution, btw: only 32 votes of 5-or-less, no 1, 2, 04 3 votes. That''s hard to do :-)</td>', 'A distinct improvement! I think you got a little robbed here; I believe this should be flirting with top 10, at least. It''s quite exquisite. Note your vote distribution, btw: only 32 votes of 5-or-less, no 1, 2, 04 3 votes. That''s hard to do :-)', '2006-06-13 02:10:49.000000', NULL, 0),
