(2511926, 342556, 15497, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your kind comments, I appriciate it a lot! This shot was taken at Geiranger, and was a reshoot of Natures King. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=336040" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/496/thumb/336040.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/496/thumb/336040.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/496/thumb/336040.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>For me a red ribbon is a win, I could not have been anymore happy with this! A big thank-you to <a href="//www.timecatcher.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Patrick Di Fruscia</a> - what a great trip!<br/> <br/>Cheers!<br/>(edit: removed orginal)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-14 18:58:46.</i></td>', 'Thank you all for your kind comments, I appriciate it a lot! This shot was taken at Geiranger, and was a reshoot of Natures King.    For me a red ribbon is a win, I could not have been anymore happy with this! A big thank-you to Patrick Di Fruscia - what a great trip! Cheers!(edit: removed orginal)', '2006-06-13 07:16:55.000000', '2006-06-14 19:58:46.000000', 0),
