(2516333, 342086, 16230, '<td valign="top">My earlier comment may have given you the impression that I don''t like the photo. Not so. Actually, I think it''s a beautiful shot. I was just wondering if the bridge is actually lit with blue lights, or if the color was added in post. I''m guessing blue lights, but either way it''s a cool photo. I''m really surprised this didn''t finish higher.</td>', 'My earlier comment may have given you the impression that I don''t like the photo. Not so. Actually, I think it''s a beautiful shot. I was just wondering if the bridge is actually lit with blue lights, or if the color was added in post. I''m guessing blue lights, but either way it''s a cool photo. I''m really surprised this didn''t finish higher.', '2006-06-14 11:43:49.000000', NULL, 0),
