(2517432, 343696, 24073, '<td valign="top">Well it won my Blue Ribbon.  It was my only 10 in the challenge.  This photo was tackled with great vision, and executed perfectly.<br/> <br/>It gives me the sense that this model just simply appeared for the shoot and then disappeared.  The mood is beautiful as well, warm, and not so flashy (if thats the right word)  Everything from the lines on the road, to the glasses on her head, even to the watch she is wearing.  As the youth of today like to put it....Its all good baby! <br/>Congrats.</td>', 'Well it won my Blue Ribbon.  It was my only 10 in the challenge.  This photo was tackled with great vision, and executed perfectly. It gives me the sense that this model just simply appeared for the shoot and then disappeared.  The mood is beautiful as well, warm, and not so flashy (if thats the right word)  Everything from the lines on the road, to the glasses on her head, even to the watch she is wearing.  As the youth of today like to put it....Its all good baby! Congrats.', '2006-06-14 17:45:17.000000', NULL, 0),
