(2528898, 343830, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: wonderful texture<br/><b>Composition</b>: very nice simmetry<br/><b>Subject</b>: quite interesting shell<br/><b>Technical</b>: good focus, nice lighting (maybe a little dark on the upper left of the shell.<br/><b>Improvement</b>: the BG in red is a bit too strong, I prefer the black one<br/><b>Summary</b>: very good shot. It seems clear you move very well on the studio environment<br/> <br/>Álex<br/></td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: wonderful textureComposition: very nice simmetrySubject: quite interesting shellTechnical: good focus, nice lighting (maybe a little dark on the upper left of the shell.Improvement: the BG in red is a bit too strong, I prefer the black oneSummary: very good shot. It seems clear you move very well on the studio environment Álex', '2006-06-19 14:57:10.000000', NULL, 0),
