(2534421, 343830, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi Shailesh-<br/> <br/>Don''t hit me, but I like the original photo much better. I think that red is a very very difficult color to photograph, since it tends to oversaturate very easily, and it overwhelms the natural color variations of the shell. The original looks much cleaner and much sharper, where the retake lacks that nice sharp quality.</td>', 'Hi Shailesh- Don''t hit me, but I like the original photo much better. I think that red is a very very difficult color to photograph, since it tends to oversaturate very easily, and it overwhelms the natural color variations of the shell. The original looks much cleaner and much sharper, where the retake lacks that nice sharp quality.', '2006-06-21 02:10:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2534475, 343668, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi Gunnar-<br/> <br/>This is definitely an improvement upon the original. I think it would have scored better if the voters weren''t getting to be so tired of the wine glass color refraction shots. Good job!</td>', 'Hi Gunnar- This is definitely an improvement upon the original. I think it would have scored better if the voters weren''t getting to be so tired of the wine glass color refraction shots. Good job!', '2006-06-21 02:16:31.000000', NULL, 0),
