(2757649, 341530, 39184, '<td valign="top">Wow, definitely a nice shot and huge improvement over the first one.  I would like to have seen Southern Gentleman''s post-processed version to see how that improved it further.  I think that it could benefit greatley from either a curves or a levels adjustment.  Levels is easier to learn and helps a lot.<br/> <br/>BTW, I just looked through the tutorials and was very surprised to find that there is not yet a tutorial on levels.</td>', 'Wow, definitely a nice shot and huge improvement over the first one.  I would like to have seen Southern Gentleman''s post-processed version to see how that improved it further.  I think that it could benefit greatley from either a curves or a levels adjustment.  Levels is easier to learn and helps a lot. BTW, I just looked through the tutorials and was very surprised to find that there is not yet a tutorial on levels.', '2006-08-24 19:23:42.000000', NULL, 0),
